{{!
  Renders the logo for a service's external source. Sources that ship with the
  Helios/Flight icon set fall through to <FlightIcon>; the open source
  alternatives (OpenBao, OpenTofu, OpenWonton and OpenDumpling) are not part of
  that set, so their official marks are inlined below. Renders nothing for
  unknown sources.
}}

